{
  "_comment": [
    "Every keyword term, and the commodity it claims. The validator fails on a",
    "term that is not declared here, so buying search traffic for something the",
    "product does not track takes a deliberate edit to this file.",
    "",
    "It exists because the first drafts advertised soybean, iron ore, thermal",
    "coal, alumina, nickel, canola, rapeseed, acucar, cafe and minerio. None of",
    "those resolve to anything: a user who searched them, installed, and typed",
    "the same word would get an empty result.",
    "",
    "`commodities` is the output of /v1/commodities. Regenerate with:",
    "  python3 -c \"from services.commodity_sentiment import _COMMODITY_ALIASES as A; print(sorted(set(A.values())))\"",
    "run from backend/, and cross-check against the live endpoint — the alias map",
    "contains canonicals that have no data yet (coltan, helium, tin, macro).",
    "",
    "soybeans, sugar, coffee, cocoa, iron_ore and coal were added to the",
    "engine rather than removed from the listing: the ingestion already",
    "fetched soybeans, the taxonomy already carried all six, and only the",
    "canonical was missing. pt-BR's subtitle leads with Soja again and",
    "en-AU's with iron ore and coal, because both are now answerable."
  ],
